rture time filter — multiple time periods\n566:#### Test: FilterSidebar departure time filter — arrival time checkboxes\n572:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by dropdown — default \"Best\"\n578:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Price (lowest)\n584:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Duration (shortest)\n590:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Departure time (earliest)\n596:#### Test: FilterSidebar sort by Arrival time (earliest)\n602:#### Test: FilterSidebar combining multiple filters\n608:#### Test: FilterSidebar filters can be used repeatedly\n614:### FlightResultCard\n616:#### Test: FlightResultCard displays airline info\n622:#### Test: FlightResultCard displays departure and arrival times\n628:#### Test: FlightResultCard displays flight duration\n634:#### Test: FlightResultCard displays stops and layover info\n640:#### Test: FlightResultCard displays price prominently\n646:#### Test: FlightResultCard displays CO₂ emissions\n652:#### Test: FlightResultCard expand to show details\n658:#### Test: FlightResultCard collapse details\n664:#### Test: FlightResultCard details show leg-by-leg breakdown\n670:#### Test: FlightResultCard details show amenities icons\n676:#### Test: FlightResultCard details show baggage allowance\n682:#### Test: FlightResultCard overnight flight shows +1 day indicator\n688:#### Test: FlightResultCard clicking \"Select\" navigates to booking page\n694:#### Test: FlightResultCard expand and collapse multiple cards\n700:### TrackPricesToggle\n702:#### Test: TrackPricesToggle is displayed on results page\n708:#### Test: TrackPricesToggle enables price tracking\n714:#### Test: TrackPricesToggle disables price tracking\n720:#### Test: TrackPricesToggle reflects existing tracked route\n726:#### Test: TrackPricesToggle tracked route appears in My Trips\n732:#### Test: TrackPricesToggle can be toggled multiple times\n738:### Pagination\n740:#### Test: Pagination \"Load more\" button is displayed at bottom of results\n746:#### Test: Pagination loading more resul