[2026-03-14T18:32:15.881Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01VSuaz6Vx8EV21tFdRMiheT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. The Explore page section exists with components listed but no test entries yet. I need to:\n\n1. PlanPageExplore: Decide on components, add sections to docs/tests.md\n2. PlanComponentDestinationMap: Add test entries for DestinationMap\n3. PlanComponentFlexibleDatesGrid: Add test entries for FlexibleDatesGrid\n4. PlanComponentDealsSection: Add test entries for DealsSection\n\nLet me look at the Explore page spec again and write comprehensive test entries for all three components.\n\nFrom the spec:\n\n### 5. Explore Page\n\n\nA discovery page for finding cheap flights with three main sections: an interactive map showing destinations and their lowest prices from a selected origin, a calendar-style grid displaying prices across different departure dates with color-coded affordability indicators, and a deals section featuring flight offers from the user's nearest airport with savings information. I should also account for the navigation sidebar in my planning.\n\nNow I'm setting up the test infrastructure—adding data-testid attributes to all interactive components, writing tests to verify each element functions correctly, and ensuring the tests cover repeated interactions to catch any state management issues.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":279,"cache_read_input_tokens":28395,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":279,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"688196e5-1b59-47b0-87c0-ecd788959136","uuid":"13ed7c0f-0533-4add-83c2-ae1f8be38225"}
